This example builds the clamr-ffmpeg container and runs an example of
clamr with checkpoint/restart.

To run it (assuming beeflow is running):
Do this in a working directory

Copy clamr_checpoint.py and Dockerfile to the current directory then enter the
following commands:

python clamr_checkpoint.py
beeflow submit clamr-example ./ ./clamr.cwl ./clamr.yml ./


